    "title_en": "NSF launches $20M pilot to accelerate commercialization of promising deep technologies from small businesses",
    "sub": "The U. S. National Science Foundation today announced a $20 million investment to launch a two-year pilot supporting small businesses in commercializing their deep-technology.",
    "sub_pt": "The U. S. National Science Foundation today announced a $20 million investment to launch a two-year pilot supporting small businesses in commercializing their deep-technology.",
