    "sub": "The Laser Interferometer Space Antenna will provide novel capability to discover and study intermediate-mass black holes at the centres of dwarf galaxies and in dense stellar.",
    "sub_pt": "The Laser Interferometer Space Antenna will provide novel capability to discover and study intermediate-mass black holes at the centres of dwarf galaxies and in dense stellar.",
